  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A rising perceived probability of oil supply interruptions prompts governments and multilateral bodies to open emergency diplomatic channels and resource-intensive negotiations with producers, transit states, and insurers to secure flows and contingency arrangements.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_ir_escalatio</data>
  <data key="d40">transatlantic_security_s</data>
