  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in oil prices raise consumer energy costs and fiscal pressures, triggering partisan debates over subsidies, taxation, and foreign policy blame that amplify domestic political polarization.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">middle_east_ir_escalatio</data>
