<edge source="global_inflation_bond_st::policy_interest_rate" target="middle_east_ir_escalatio::military_tension_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy rates in major economies raise sovereign and corporate financing costs for regional governments and external patrons, forcing fiscal retrenchment that reduces security cooperation and proxy funding and thereby incentivizes rivals to test red lines or prompt proxy escalations.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_bond_st</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_ir_escalatio</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_inflation_bond_st::policy_interest_rate" target="transatlantic_security_s::alliance_unity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy rates raise sovereign and private borrowing costs and debt service burdens unevenly across allies, producing divergent fiscal pressures and domestic tradeoffs that reduce willingness and ability to coordinate defence spending and burden-sharing.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_bond_st</data>
  <data key="d40">transatlantic_security_s</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_inflation_bond_st::policy_interest_rate" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::supply_chain_pressure" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising policy rates increase borrowing and inventory-carry costs for chipmakers and their customers, causing order cancellations and slower new equipment spending that eases capacity tightness and lead-time pressure across AI‑chip supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_bond_st</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_inflation_bond_st::policy_interest_rate" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::reg_scrutiny_intensity" id="0">
