  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy rates raise financial stress on high-growth semiconductor and AI firms, producing more shareholder complaints, enforcement referrals and regulator attention to risk disclosures and national‑security risks, thereby increasing oversight intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_bond_st</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
