  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising ten‑year yields increase the medium‑term cost of financing reconstruction and prolonged military support, incentivizing combatants and sponsors to seek negotiated settlements or intensified diplomatic talks to limit fiscal exposure.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_inflation_bond_st</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
