  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A jump in long-term yields depresses equity valuations and liquidity in the sector, which increases investor activism, restatement risk and the likelihood of regulatory or judicial probes into firms and executives in the AI‑chip industry.</data>
